 "design": "decode-ready READINESS.md (2026-10-28, read-only against 0144010d), recommendation (b) followed exactly, and the owner's decisions of 2026-10-28: D2-1 decision DD6 superseded (decode CAL runs now, tile rental B is not run; decode uses A2's constants through the first addendum, its gate reading GO); D2-2 the cells where an active expert holds a second M-tile are DESCRIPTIVE (out of the fit, the rho selection and every E1 bar; read as SIGMA-D against v4d's sigma-1 price and an L2-served estimate); D2-3 700 W stated and read back from the session's power-set.txt, else NOT SCORED; D2-4 the knee rows (p 5.75, 3.75) DESCRIPTIVE and the two byte units nodrop; D2-5 the rental sequence: CAL, then on GO the mechanical finalisation and the blind rental; and after the build review (build-D2-review REVIEW.md, GO-WITH-FIXES): M1 the certified domain stated verbatim, m9 SIGMA-D's reading bands and NOT READ rule, m3 the blind bars from the kept cells' replicate noise",
